= Norbert Barlicki

Barlicki is one of the few who has a background in rural and agricultural affairs in the PPS due to his history in participating in agricultural unions.

- @agriculture
- @rural_campaign
- @root: Return to main

@agriculture
title: Agricultural Policy
subtitle: Barlicki is the Minister of Agriculture.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and pps_in_government and agriculture_minister_party == "PPS"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not pps_in_government : The PPS is not in government. ?][? if agriculture_minister_party != "PPS": The PPS does not have the Agriculture Ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; agricultural_policy_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: agricultural_policy


@rural_campaign
title: Rural Campaign
subtitle: Try to campaign among the rural populace.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and rural_policy > 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if rural_policy == 0 : We have not enacted any rural policies. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; peasants_pps += 6*(1-dissent); peoples_party_support += 1

We have increased our campaigning among farmers and the rural populace.
